---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy – Sandhan Westphal">
  <Nav />
  <main class="legal">
    <div class="legal__inner">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <h2>1. Controller</h2>
      <p>
        Sandhan Jürgen Westphal<br />
        Raimundstr. 10 B, 04177 Leipzig, Germany<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:Sandhanwestphal@gmail.com">Sandhanwestphal@gmail.com</a>
      </p>

      <h2>2. Data collection</h2>
      <p>
        When visiting this website, the hosting provider (Cloudflare) automatically
        stores information in server log files: browser type, operating system,
        referrer URL, IP address and time of request. This data is not merged with
        other data sources.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Contact form</h2>
      <p>
        If you use the contact form, your details (name, email, message) are stored
        to process your enquiry. This data is not passed on without your consent and
        you may object to storage at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Google Fonts</h2>
      <p>
        This website uses Google Fonts. When the page loads, a connection is established
        to Google LLC servers, during which your IP address may be transmitted. For more
        information see <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, and restriction of
        processing of your stored personal data, as well as the right to data
        portability. Please contact me by email to exercise these rights.
      </p>

      <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to homepage</a>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal { padding: 10rem 2rem 6rem; min-height: 100vh; background: var(--sand); }
  .legal__inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); color: var(--deep); margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--deep); margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem; }
  p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  a { color: var(--terracotta); }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .back-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-light); }
</style>
